# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Phase 1 .gitignore
# Constructed by inspection of the actual repository (Phase 0 §22): the repo
# contained ONLY docs/ before Phase 1, so nothing pre-existing is at risk of
# being un-tracked by these rules. Model CONFIG and METADATA are deliberately
# NOT ignored - only large binary weights and generated audio are.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Model weights and checkpoints - never committed (Phase 0 §23)
*.pt
*.pth
*.ckpt
*.safetensors
*.bin
*.onnx
*.gguf
*.h5
*.msgpack

# Local model store - weights live here, outside Git.
# models/manifest.yaml and models/README.md ARE tracked (see negations below).
models/**
!models/
!models/README.md
!models/manifest.yaml
!models/**/*.json
!models/**/*.yaml
!models/**/*.md

# Datasets and generated audio (Phase 0 Step 9: audio stays outside Git)
datasets/
data/raw/
data/audio/
outputs/
artifacts/
*.wav
*.mp3
*.flac
*.ogg
*.opus

# Secrets - never commit HF tokens or credentials (Phase 0 §22)
.env
.env.*
*.key
*.pem
secrets.yaml
.huggingface/
hf_token*

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
build/
dist/
.venv/
venv/
env/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/

# OS / editor
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.idea/
.vscode/
